# Default lychee ignore list for STScI notebook repositories.
#
# Each non-comment line is a regular expression matched against URLs. Matching
# links are skipped by the weekly broken-link check (the unified workflow's
# enable-link-check). Add repository-specific exclusions below.

# Auth-gated / noisy endpoints (migrated from the old broken_link_checker.yml)
acspsf\.stsci\.edu
github\.com/spacetelescope/hst_notebooks/issues/new
